{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2026-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1786838400, "end_date": 1787529599, "month_true_total": 21, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:26:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "233427603", "author": {"steamid": "76561198259282920", "personaname": "Kaio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198259282920/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 286, "last_played": 1788005421, "avatar": "840c3970f5b4c73c0f2038d910c4e75263de622b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's fulfilling and challenging, but boring.", "timestamp_created": 1787408349, "timestamp_updated": 1788002759, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.434782594442367554", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233312089", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017795792", "personaname": "gabriefacu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017795792/", "num_games_owned": 299, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 4851, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4851, "last_played": 1775006301, "avatar": "83a9cd261e2942950d5812b336b611f166f36243"}, "language": "english", "review": "King of roguelikes", "timestamp_created": 1787279337, "timestamp_updated": 1787279337, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233093504", "author": {"steamid": "76561198230593528", "personaname": "OPPOSITE LANES", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kiwifarms/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 100, "playtime_forever": 1521, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1521, "last_played": 1787017977, "avatar": "c22b947ac1d9c02ad444c0a113f66b1bc224a425"}, "language": "english", "review": "If I had played this game before playing RoR2 for hundreds of hours, I think I would have a far greater appreciation for this game than I do. Unfortunately, having played so much of the sequel, it's hard to look at this game without comparing it to that. The music and graphics are great, but I don't think the gameplay works as well as it does in the sequel. This is largely because the gameplay is basically the same for every survivor: run away from a group, activate one or more abilities, run away again until the abilities are off cooldown, activate abilities again, and repeat ad nauseam. In a 2D game, this can get pretty old pretty fast. It also makes melee survivors (and sniper) feel significantly worse to play. The game is also fairly difficult if you're used to the sequel, but with enough runs you'll end up getting used to it. It's a fun game and I can see why so many people like it, I just don't think it's as good as the sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1787019354, "timestamp_updated": 1787019354, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233076830", "author": {"steamid": "76561199445542318", "personaname": "Chuckle Phuckle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cucklin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 189, "playtime_last_tw